From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Ochocki <jonochocki@icloud.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 18:57:08 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Record and merge game running time across Apple devices

Keep dated cumulative durations under fresh segment IDs in one document per title.
Merge restored and offline histories by union of IDs and maximum duration
per ID, independently of game save archives. Checkpoint changed records transactionally in a local SQLite database and publish
on lifecycle transitions, retaining failed publications for later retry.

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Record per-game running time and merge offline histories on Mac and iOS
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#1223
---
